        "official_en_sha256": "ddd5afe010edb908f48c6ae6836bd4c63eb643a705bf864392772bee33ab544a"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "そんなことはないさ。\r\n友だちとか仲間っていう関係だってある。",
        "official_en": "No, not at all. Friends can be close, too.",
        "real_en": "Not at all. You can be close as friends or companions, too."
